      "part": "problem",
      "original_record": "before",
      "value": "If $U=\\{2,4,6,8,10,12\\}$ is the universal set and $B=\\{2,6,10\\},$ then the complement of $B$ is",
      "original_html_sha256": "ad749e4ead12cc4533d5044b80a9fe61ace31a35f0b198e78dece2fc7aca2fbe",
      "extractor_sha256": "1591183da328a4140792793d2cc113fd535ab5f25bc7f284ceb1b6f251efad18",
      "source_file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14070857/repairs/source-provenance-v2/structured-source/source/ad749e4ead12cc4533d5044b80a9fe61ace31a35f0b198e78dece2fc7aca2fbe.html",
