    },
    {
      "part": "worked_solution",
      "original_record": "history",
      "value": "The complement of $B,$ denoted $\\overset{―}{B},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $B.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $B$ are $4,$ $8,$   and $12.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $B$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{B}=\\{4,8,12\\}.\n$$",
      "original_html_sha256": "e1c0feb3e8f59527f7c3a8b8d35e253ccf20de2be3192c1eaf50e7e7006bfbcd",
